      </section>

      <!-- ================= 2.5 DOUTE & NÉGATION ================= -->
      <section data-topic="subjonctif" data-topic-name="Le Subjonctif" data-sub="Doute &amp; Négation">

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Doute &amp; négation — when certainty disappears</h2>
            <p class="editable-field">Verbs of opinion (<em>penser, croire, être sûr</em>) take the <strong>indicatif</strong> when affirmative — but the <strong>subjonctif</strong> when negative or questioned.</p>
            <div class="three-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Affirmatif → indicatif</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je pense qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">est</span> honnête.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I think he is honest.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">Négatif → subjonctif</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne pense pas qu'il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> honnête.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't think he is honest.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Interrogatif → subjonctif</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Penses-tu qu'il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> honnête ?</p>
                <p class="gloss">Do you think he is honest?</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Always subjunctive, even affirmative:</strong>
                <span class="highlight hl-aux">douter que</span>
                <span class="highlight hl-aux">nier que</span>
                <span class="highlight hl-aux">il est douteux que</span>
                <span class="highlight hl-aux">il n'est pas certain que</span>
                <span class="gloss">— because doubt is built into their meaning.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule — la négation change tout</h2>
            <div class="formula-pipeline">
              <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Opinion niée</span><span class="f-value">Je ne crois pas</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--gold);"><span class="f-label">que</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--gold);">que</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--purple);"><span class="f-label">Subjonctif</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--purple);">ce soit vrai</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <table class="subj-table">
                <tr><th>Affirmatif (indicatif)</th><th>Négatif (subjonctif)</th></tr>
                <tr><td>Je pense qu'il <strong>vient</strong>.</td><td>Je ne pense pas qu'il <span class="key-form">vienne</span>.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Je crois qu'elle <strong>a</strong> raison.</td><td>Je ne crois pas qu'elle <span class="key-form">ait</span> raison.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Il est sûr que c'<strong>est</strong> vrai.</td><td>Il n'est pas sûr que ce <span class="key-form">soit</span> vrai.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Je trouve qu'il <strong>fait</strong> beau.</td><td>Je ne trouve pas qu'il <span class="key-form">fasse</span> beau.</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les exceptions — espérer et se douter</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">ESPÉRER — never subjunctive</h3>
                <p class="example-text">J'espère qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">viendra</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I hope he will come.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'espère pas qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">vienne</span>… <span class="gloss">rare and awkward — avoid it entirely</span></p>
                <p class="gloss">Remember: <em>espérer</em> behaves like a certainty verb in French.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">DOUTER vs SE DOUTER — opposites!</h3>
                <p><strong>douter que</strong> = to doubt → <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">subjonctif</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je doute qu'il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">vienne</span>. <span class="gloss">I doubt he'll come.</span></p>
                <p><strong>se douter que</strong> = to suspect / be fairly sure → <span class="highlight hl-verb">indicatif</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je me doute qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">viendra</span>. <span class="gloss">I suspect he will come.</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Also worth knowing:</strong> after a superlative or <em>le seul / le premier / le dernier</em>, French often uses the subjonctif —
              <em>C'est le meilleur livre que je <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">connaisse</span>.</em> <span class="gloss">It's the best book I know.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — check affirmative or negative FIRST</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">✗ Wrong</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je pense qu'il <span class="highlight hl-neg">soit</span> gentil.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne crois pas qu'il <span class="highlight hl-neg">est</span> là.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je doute qu'il <span class="highlight hl-neg">viendra</span>.</p>
                <p class="example-text">J'espère qu'il <span class="highlight hl-neg">soit</span> content.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">✓ Right</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je pense qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">est</span> gentil. <span class="gloss">affirmative → indicatif</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne crois pas qu'il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> là. <span class="gloss">negative → subjonctif</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je doute qu'il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">vienne</span>. <span class="gloss">douter → always subjonctif</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">J'espère qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">sera</span> content. <span class="gloss">espérer → indicatif</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">🔑 <strong>Two-second routine:</strong> ① Is the main verb <em>penser / croire / trouver / être sûr</em>?
              ② Is it negative or a question? → subjonctif. Otherwise → indicatif. ③ Is it <em>douter / nier</em>? → always subjonctif.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text">Je ne <span class="highlight hl-aux">pense pas que</span> ce film <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> intéressant.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I don't think this film is interesting.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-aux">Doutez-vous que</span> nous <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">disions</span> la vérité ?</p>
              <p class="gloss">Do you doubt that we are telling the truth?</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Il n'est pas <span class="highlight hl-aux">certain qu'</span>elle <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">puisse</span> venir.</p>
              <p class="gloss">It is not certain that she can come.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-aux">crois qu'</span>il <span class="highlight hl-verb">a</span> raison, mais je ne <span class="highlight hl-aux">crois pas qu'</span>il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">ait</span> tous les faits.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I think he is right, but I don't think he has all the facts. — both moods in one sentence</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — expressing an opinion</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.5 — Les médias</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne pense pas que la télévision <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> toujours négative.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't think television is always negative.</p>
                <h3>L.4 — Le plaisir de lire</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne crois pas que les jeunes <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">lisent</span> moins qu'avant.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't believe young people read less than before.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'est pas sûr que les gouvernements <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">agissent</span> assez vite.</p>
                <p class="gloss">It is not certain that governments are acting fast enough.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.6 — Chacun ses goûts</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je doute que tout le monde <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">aime</span> ce genre de musique.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I doubt everyone likes this kind of music.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">💡 <strong>Opinion essays:</strong> a balanced answer needs both moods —
              <em>Je pense que… mais je ne crois pas que…</em> Using the subjunctive correctly in the second half signals real command of French.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Indicatif or subjonctif?</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="soit">
                <p class="q-text">1. Je ne pense pas qu'il _____ malade. <span class="gloss">(être)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">est</button><button class="option-btn">soit</button><button class="option-btn">sera</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="a">
                <p class="q-text">2. Je crois qu'elle _____ raison. <span class="gloss">(avoir)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ait</button><button class="option-btn">a</button><button class="option-btn">aura</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="vienne">
                <p class="q-text">3. Je doute qu'il _____ ce soir. <span class="gloss">(venir)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">vient</button><button class="option-btn">viendra</button><button class="option-btn">vienne</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="sache">
                <p class="q-text">4. Crois-tu qu'il _____ la réponse ? <span class="gloss">(savoir)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">sait</button><button class="option-btn">sache</button><button class="option-btn">saura</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="fera">
                <p class="q-text">5. J'espère qu'il _____ beau demain. <span class="gloss">(faire)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">fasse</button><button class="option-btn">fera</button><button class="option-btn">ferait</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-dou-8" data-step="Pratique — à compléter">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">8</span> Pratique — à compléter</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Complete the sentence</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">1. Je ne crois pas que ce _____ (être) une bonne idée.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="soit" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">2. Il n'est pas certain qu'elle _____ (pouvoir) nous aider.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="puisse" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Je pense qu'ils _____ (arriver) demain matin. <span class="gloss">(futur)</span></p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="arriveront" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Doutez-vous que nous _____ (dire) la vérité ?</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="disions" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. Je ne trouve pas qu'il _____ (faire) froid aujourd'hui.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="fasse" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <!-- ================= 2.6 CONJONCTIONS ================= -->
      <section data-topic="subjonctif" data-topic-name="Le Subjonctif" data-sub="Les Conjonctions">

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les Conjonctions — certain linking words demand it</h2>
            <p class="editable-field">Some conjunctions <strong>always</strong> take the subjonctif — no thinking required. Learn the list and you get these marks free.</p>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">TOUJOURS + subjonctif</h3>
                <p>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">bien que</span> <span class="gloss">although</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">quoique</span> <span class="gloss">although</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">pour que</span> <span class="gloss">so that</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">afin que</span> <span class="gloss">so that</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">avant que</span> <span class="gloss">before</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">jusqu'à ce que</span> <span class="gloss">until</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">à condition que</span> <span class="gloss">provided that</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">sans que</span> <span class="gloss">without</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-aux">à moins que</span> <span class="gloss">unless</span>
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">JAMAIS + subjonctif (indicatif)</h3>
                <p>
                  <span class="highlight hl-verb">parce que</span> <span class="gloss">because</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-verb">après que</span> <span class="gloss">after</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-verb">pendant que</span> <span class="gloss">while</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-verb">depuis que</span> <span class="gloss">since</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-verb">dès que</span> <span class="gloss">as soon as</span>
                  <span class="highlight hl-verb">puisque</span> <span class="gloss">since</span>
                </p>
                <p class="gloss">⚠️ <strong>avant que</strong> → subjonctif, but <strong>après que</strong> → indicatif. This pair is examined often.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule</h2>
            <div class="formula-pipeline">
              <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--gold);"><span class="f-label">Conjonction</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--gold);">Bien que</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--purple);"><span class="f-label">Sujet + subjonctif</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--purple);">il soit fatigué</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">→</div>
              <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Proposition principale</span><span class="f-value">il travaille</span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <table class="subj-table">
                <tr><th>Conjonction</th><th>Exemple</th><th>Anglais</th></tr>
                <tr><td>bien que</td><td>Bien qu'il <span class="key-form">pleuve</span>, je sors.</td><td class="gloss">Although it's raining, I'm going out.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>pour que</td><td>Je parle lentement pour que tu <span class="key-form">comprennes</span>.</td><td class="gloss">I speak slowly so that you understand.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>avant que</td><td>Pars avant qu'il <span class="key-form">arrive</span>.</td><td class="gloss">Leave before he arrives.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>jusqu'à ce que</td><td>Attends jusqu'à ce que je <span class="key-form">revienne</span>.</td><td class="gloss">Wait until I come back.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>à condition que</td><td>Je viendrai à condition que tu <span class="key-form">sois</span> là.</td><td class="gloss">I'll come provided you're there.</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les exceptions — même sujet → préposition + infinitif</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="editable-field">When both halves have the <strong>same subject</strong>, French replaces the conjunction with a preposition + infinitive.</p>
              <table class="subj-table">
                <tr><th>Conjonction (2 sujets)</th><th>Préposition (1 sujet)</th></tr>
                <tr><td>pour que + subjonctif</td><td class="key-form">pour + infinitif</td></tr>
                <tr><td>afin que + subjonctif</td><td class="key-form">afin de + infinitif</td></tr>
                <tr><td>avant que + subjonctif</td><td class="key-form">avant de + infinitif</td></tr>
                <tr><td>sans que + subjonctif</td><td class="key-form">sans + infinitif</td></tr>
                <tr><td>à condition que + subjonctif</td><td class="key-form">à condition de + infinitif</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="two-columns fragment">
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <p class="example-text">Je travaille <span class="highlight hl-aux">pour que</span> ma famille <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> heureuse.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I work so that my family is happy. — two subjects</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <p class="example-text">Je travaille <span class="highlight hl-verb">pour réussir</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I work in order to succeed. — one subject</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — <em>avant que</em> vs <em>après que</em></h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">AVANT QUE → subjonctif</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Finis tes devoirs <span class="highlight hl-aux">avant que</span> tes parents <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">rentrent</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Finish your homework before your parents come home.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Logic: the action hasn't happened yet — it's not a fact.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">APRÈS QUE → indicatif</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je sortirai <span class="highlight hl-verb">après que</span> tu <span class="highlight hl-verb">seras</span> rentré.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I'll go out after you have come home.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Logic: by then it will be an accomplished fact.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box red content-box fragment">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">Other frequent errors</h3>
              <p class="example-text">✗ Bien qu'il <span class="highlight hl-neg">est</span> tard, je reste. → ✓ Bien qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">soit</span> tard</p>
              <p class="example-text">✗ Pour que je <span class="highlight hl-neg">réussis</span>… → ✓ <span class="highlight hl-verb">Pour réussir</span> <span class="gloss">same subject</span></p>
              <p class="example-text">✗ Parce qu'il <span class="highlight hl-neg">soit</span> malade → ✓ Parce qu'il <span class="highlight hl-verb">est</span> malade</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-aux">Bien qu'</span>il <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">ait</span> beaucoup de travail, il sort avec ses amis.</p>
              <p class="gloss">Although he has a lot of work, he goes out with his friends.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Le professeur répète <span class="highlight hl-aux">pour que</span> tous les élèves <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">comprennent</span>.</p>
              <p class="gloss">The teacher repeats so that all the pupils understand.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Nous attendrons <span class="highlight hl-aux">jusqu'à ce que</span> tu <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">sois</span> prêt.</p>
              <p class="gloss">We will wait until you are ready.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Il est parti <span class="highlight hl-aux">sans que</span> personne le <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">voie</span>.</p>
              <p class="gloss">He left without anyone seeing him. — voir → voie</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — building complex sentences</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Bien que le problème <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> grave, des solutions existent.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Although the problem is serious, solutions exist.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il faut agir avant qu'il ne <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> trop tard.</p>
                <p class="gloss">We must act before it is too late.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.2 — Après le bac</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je travaille dur pour que mes parents <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soient</span> fiers de moi.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I work hard so that my parents are proud of me.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.3 — Chercher du travail</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je prendrai ce poste à condition que le salaire <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">soit</span> correct.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I'll take this job provided the salary is decent.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">💡 <strong>Top mark move:</strong> starting a paragraph with <em>Bien que…</em> shows you can handle a subordinate clause and the subjunctive at once. Prepare one such opening sentence for any essay topic.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Choose the correct form</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="soit">
                <p class="q-text">1. Bien qu'il _____ malade, il est venu. <span class="gloss">(être)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">est</button><button class="option-btn">soit</button><button class="option-btn">était</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="comprennes">
                <p class="q-text">2. Je répète pour que tu _____. <span class="gloss">(comprendre)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">comprends</button><button class="option-btn">comprennes</button><button class="option-btn">comprendras</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="est">
                <p class="q-text">3. Je reste parce qu'il _____ tard. <span class="gloss">(être)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">soit</button><button class="option-btn">est</button><button class="option-btn">serait</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="partes">
                <p class="q-text">4. Téléphone-moi avant que tu _____. <span class="gloss">(partir)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">pars</button><button class="option-btn">partiras</button><button class="option-btn">partes</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="pour réussir">
                <p class="q-text">5. Je travaille dur _____. <span class="gloss">(réussir — même sujet)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">pour que je réussisse</button><button class="option-btn">pour réussir</button><button class="option-btn">pour que je réussis</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-conj-8" data-step="Pratique — à compléter">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">8</span> Pratique — à compléter</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Complete the sentence</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">1. Bien que nous _____ (avoir) peu de temps, nous finirons.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ayons" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">2. Attends jusqu'à ce que je _____ (revenir).</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="revienne" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Il explique afin que tout le monde _____ (savoir) la règle.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="sache" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Je viendrai à moins qu'il ne _____ (pleuvoir).</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="pleuve" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. Nous sortirons après que le film _____ (finir). <span class="gloss">(indicatif !)</span></p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="finira|sera fini" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <!-- ================= TOPIC 2 CLOSER ================= -->
      <section data-topic="subjonctif" data-topic-name="Le Subjonctif" data-sub="Synthèse &amp; Examen">

        <section data-slide-id="subj-fin-1" data-step="Tableau de référence">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">📊 Tableau de référence — subjonctif ou indicatif ?</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">SUBJONCTIF</h3>
                <p><strong>Volonté</strong> — vouloir / souhaiter / exiger que</p>
                <p><strong>Émotion</strong> — être content / triste / avoir peur que</p>
                <p><strong>Nécessité</strong> — il faut / il est important que</p>
                <p><strong>Doute</strong> — douter que · ne pas penser que</p>
                <p><strong>Conjonctions</strong> — bien que · pour que · avant que · jusqu'à ce que</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">INDICATIF</h3>
                <p><strong>Certitude</strong> — être sûr / certain / évident que</p>
                <p><strong>Opinion affirmative</strong> — penser / croire / trouver que</p>
                <p><strong>Espoir</strong> — espérer que</p>
                <p><strong>Constat</strong> — savoir / dire / remarquer que</p>
                <p><strong>Conjonctions</strong> — parce que · après que · pendant que · dès que</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">Les 7 irréguliers à connaître absolument</h3>
              <p>
                être → <span class="key-form">sois</span> ·
                avoir → <span class="key-form">aie</span> ·
                aller → <span class="key-form">aille</span> ·
                faire → <span class="key-form">fasse</span> ·
                pouvoir → <span class="key-form">puisse</span> ·
                savoir → <span class="key-form">sache</span> ·
                vouloir → <span class="key-form">veuille</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-fin-2" data-step="Cartes mémoire">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">🃏 Cartes mémoire — les irréguliers</h2>
            <p class="editable-field gloss">Click to flip. Mark ✓ known / ↻ review — your marks are saved.</p>
            <div class="flip-card-grid">
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>ÊTRE</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que je…</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que je sois</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>AVOIR</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que j'…</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que j'aie</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>ALLER</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que j'…</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que j'aille</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>FAIRE</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que je…</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que je fasse</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>POUVOIR</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que je…</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que je puisse</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>SAVOIR</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que je…</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que je sache</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>PRENDRE</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que je / que nous</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que je prenne<br>que nous prenions</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
              <div class="flip-card"><div class="flip-card-inner"><div class="flip-card-front"><strong>VENIR</strong><br><span style="font-size:.8em;">que je / que nous</span></div><div class="flip-card-back">que je vienne<br>que nous venions</div></div><div class="fc-marks"><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="known">✓</button><button class="fc-mark" data-mark="again">↻</button></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-fin-3" data-step="Examen CBSE">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">📝 Examen blanc — Le Subjonctif</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text"><span class="q-tag">CBSE 2024</span>1. Il est important que nous _____ (pouvoir) assister à cette fête.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="puissions" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text"><span class="q-tag">CBSE 2024</span>2. Ma mère exige que nous _____ (manger) ensemble.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="mangions" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Il faut que tu _____ (être) plus patient.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="sois" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Bien qu'elle _____ (avoir) mal, elle continue.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ait" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. Je ne pense pas qu'ils _____ (venir) ce soir.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="viennent" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">6. Nous partons avant qu'il ne _____ (faire) nuit.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="fasse" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 6</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="subj-fin-4" data-step="Check-list">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">✅ Check-list — Le Subjonctif</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <p>☐ Is there a <strong>trigger</strong> — volonté, émotion, nécessité, doute, or a conjunction?</p>
                <p>☐ Is the word <strong>que</strong> present?</p>
                <p>☐ Are there <strong>two different subjects</strong>? If not → infinitive.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <p>☐ Did I build the stem from the <strong>ils</strong> form?</p>
                <p>☐ Is it one of the <strong>7 irregulars</strong>?</p>
                <p>☐ For nous/vous, did I use <strong>-ions / -iez</strong>?</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">🎯 <strong>Exam note:</strong> Le Subjonctif is one of the topics you may choose in Section C.
              Because its triggers are a fixed list, it is one of the most <strong>predictable</strong> five marks on the paper — learn the list and the 7 irregulars.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>
      <!-- ==================================================================
           TOPIC 3 — LA NÉGATION
           =================================================================== -->
      <section data-topic="negation" data-topic-name="La Négation" data-sub="Ne… pas">

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Ne… pas — the basic negation</h2>
            <p class="editable-field">French negation is a <strong>sandwich</strong>: two words wrap around the verb. English uses one word ("not"); French always uses two.</p>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <div class="formula-pipeline">
                <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Sujet</span><span class="f-value">Je</span></div>
                <div class="f-op">+</div>
                <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--crimson);"><span class="f-label">NE</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--crimson);">ne</span></div>
                <div class="f-op">+</div>
                <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Verbe + PAS</span><span class="f-value">parle <span style="color:var(--crimson);">pas</span></span></div>
              </div>
              <p class="example-text" style="text-align:center; margin-top:10px;">
                <span class="highlight hl-subject">Je</span>
                <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span>
                <span class="highlight hl-verb">parle</span>
                <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span> anglais.
              </p>
              <p class="gloss" style="text-align:center;">I do not speak English.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>NE becomes N'</strong> before a vowel or silent h:
                <em>Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>aime pas.</em> <span class="gloss">I don't like.</span> ·
                <em>Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>habite pas ici.</em> <span class="gloss">He doesn't live here.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule — where does the sandwich close?</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Temps simple — around the verb</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">mange</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't eat. — présent</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">viendra</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He won't come. — futur</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Temps composé — around the AUXILIARY</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">ai</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">mangé</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I have not eaten. — passé composé</p>
                <p class="example-text">Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">était</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">partie</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">She had not left. — plus-que-parfait</p>
                <p class="gloss">⚠️ Never <em>« n'ai mangé pas »</em>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">Two more positions</h3>
              <p><strong>Avec un pronom</strong> — the pronoun stays inside the sandwich:<br>
                <em>Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-pronoun">le</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">vois</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span>.</em> <span class="gloss">I don't see him.</span></p>
              <p><strong>Avec un infinitif</strong> — both words go together, before it:<br>
                <em>Il préfère <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne pas</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">sortir</span>.</em> <span class="gloss">He prefers not to go out.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">L'article devient DE après une négation</h2>
            <p class="editable-field">After a negation, the indefinite and partitive articles (<em>un, une, des, du, de la</em>) all become <strong>de</strong> or <strong>d'</strong>.</p>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <table class="subj-table">
                <tr><th>Affirmatif</th><th>Négatif</th><th>Anglais</th></tr>
                <tr><td>J'ai <strong>un</strong> stylo.</td><td>Je n'ai pas <span class="key-form">de</span> stylo.</td><td class="gloss">I don't have a pen.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Elle mange <strong>des</strong> fruits.</td><td>Elle ne mange pas <span class="key-form">de</span> fruits.</td><td class="gloss">She doesn't eat fruit.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Je bois <strong>du</strong> lait.</td><td>Je ne bois pas <span class="key-form">de</span> lait.</td><td class="gloss">I don't drink milk.</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Il a <strong>de l'</strong>argent.</td><td>Il n'a pas <span class="key-form">d'</span>argent.</td><td class="gloss">He has no money.</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Deux exceptions à cette règle</h3>
              <p>① <strong>Definite articles never change:</strong><br>
                J'aime <strong>le</strong> café → Je n'aime pas <strong>le</strong> café. <span class="gloss">not "de café"</span></p>
              <p>② <strong>After être, the article stays:</strong><br>
                C'est <strong>un</strong> professeur → Ce n'est pas <strong>un</strong> professeur. <span class="gloss">not "pas de professeur"</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — the four classic errors</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">✗ Wrong</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">parle pas</span> français.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'a mangé pas</span>.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai pas <span class="highlight hl-neg">un</span> frère.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne le pas</span> vois.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">✓ Right</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-verb">ne parle pas</span> français. <span class="gloss">ne is compulsory in writing</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-verb">n'a pas mangé</span>. <span class="gloss">pas before the participle</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai pas <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> frère. <span class="gloss">un → de</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-verb">ne le vois pas</span>. <span class="gloss">pronoun inside the sandwich</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">💡 <strong>Spoken vs written:</strong> in casual speech the French often drop <em>ne</em> (<em>"Je sais pas"</em>).
              In your exam that is an <strong>error</strong>. Always write both halves.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-subject">Nous</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-verb">habitons</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span> à Paris.</p>
              <p class="gloss">We don't live in Paris. — simple tense, n' before vowel</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">a</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">fini</span> ses devoirs.</p>
              <p class="gloss">She hasn't finished her homework. — passé composé, around the auxiliary</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> voiture.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I don't have a car. — une → de</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Il m'a demandé de <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne pas</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">partir</span>.</p>
              <p class="gloss">He asked me not to leave. — both words before the infinitive</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — Entre Jeunes themes</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.7 — En pleine forme</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne mange pas <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> fast-food pendant la semaine.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't eat fast food during the week.</p>
                <h3>L.5 — Les médias</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Mes parents n'aiment pas les réseaux sociaux.</p>
                <p class="gloss">My parents don't like social networks. — definite article stays</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Nous ne devons pas <span class="highlight hl-verb">jeter</span> les déchets dans la rue.</p>
                <p class="gloss">We must not throw rubbish in the street.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.3 — Chercher du travail</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'a pas encore trouvé <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> travail.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He hasn't found a job yet.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Choose the correct negation</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="Je ne comprends pas">
                <p class="q-text">1. _____ la question. <span class="gloss">(comprendre)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">Je comprends pas</button><button class="option-btn">Je ne comprends pas</button><button class="option-btn">Je ne pas comprends</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="n'a pas vu">
                <p class="q-text">2. Elle _____ le film. <span class="gloss">(ne pas voir — PC)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">n'a vu pas</button><button class="option-btn">n'a pas vu</button><button class="option-btn">ne a pas vu</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="de sœur">
                <p class="q-text">3. Je n'ai pas _____. <span class="gloss">(une sœur)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">une sœur</button><button class="option-btn">de sœur</button><button class="option-btn">des sœur</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne les aime pas">
                <p class="q-text">4. Il _____. <span class="gloss">(ne pas aimer + les)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne les aime pas</button><button class="option-btn">n'aime pas les</button><button class="option-btn">ne pas les aime</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne pas fumer">
                <p class="q-text">5. Le médecin conseille de _____. <span class="gloss">(fumer)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne fumer pas</button><button class="option-btn">ne pas fumer</button><button class="option-btn">pas fumer</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pas-8" data-step="Pratique — à compléter">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">8</span> Pratique — à compléter</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Mettez à la forme négative</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">1. Je parle italien. → Je _____ italien.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne parle pas" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">2. Il a compris. → Il _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'a pas compris" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Nous avons un chien. → Nous n'avons pas _____ chien.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="de" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Elle est partie. → Elle _____ partie.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'est pas" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. Tu me comprends. → Tu _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne me comprends pas" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <!-- ================= 3.2 NE… JAMAIS ================= -->
      <section data-topic="negation" data-topic-name="La Négation" data-sub="Ne… jamais">

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Ne… jamais — never</h2>
            <p class="editable-field">Replaces <em>pas</em> to mean <strong>never / not ever</strong>. It negates frequency rather than the action itself.</p>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Le contraste</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je vais <span class="highlight hl-verb">toujours</span> au cinéma. <span class="gloss">I always go to the cinema.</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je vais <span class="highlight hl-verb">souvent</span> au cinéma. <span class="gloss">I often go.</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> vais <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> au cinéma. <span class="gloss">I never go.</span></p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Réponse à une question</h3>
                <p class="example-text">— Tu fumes ? <span class="gloss">Do you smoke?</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">— <span class="highlight hl-neg">Jamais</span> ! <span class="gloss">Never!</span></p>
                <p class="gloss">Used alone as an answer, <em>jamais</em> needs no <em>ne</em>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule — jamais takes the place of pas</h2>
            <div class="formula-pipeline">
              <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Sujet</span><span class="f-value">Je</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--crimson);"><span class="f-label">NE</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--crimson);">ne</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Verbe + JAMAIS</span><span class="f-value">bois <span style="color:var(--crimson);">jamais</span></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Temps simple</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">ment</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He never lies.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Temps composé — before the participle</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">ai</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">visité</span> la France.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I have never visited France.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Article rule applies too:</strong>
              <em>Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> bois <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> café.</em>
              <span class="gloss">I never drink coffee.</span> — <em>du</em> becomes <em>de</em>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les exceptions — jamais sans « ne »</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Sans « ne » = « ever »</h3>
                <p>In questions and after <em>si</em>, <em>jamais</em> can mean <strong>ever</strong> — a positive meaning!</p>
                <p class="example-text">As-tu <span class="highlight hl-aux">jamais</span> vu un tigre ?</p>
                <p class="gloss">Have you ever seen a tiger?</p>
                <p class="example-text">Si <span class="highlight hl-aux">jamais</span> tu viens, appelle-moi.</p>
                <p class="gloss">If ever you come, call me.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Expressions figées</h3>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> de la vie ! <span class="gloss">Never in my life! / No way!</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">à <span class="highlight hl-aux">jamais</span> <span class="gloss">forever</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">plus que <span class="highlight hl-aux">jamais</span> <span class="gloss">more than ever</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Combining negations:</strong> <em>ne… plus jamais</em> = never again —
              <em>Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> le ferai <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus jamais</span>.</em>
              <span class="gloss">I will never do it again.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — never write <em>pas</em> and <em>jamais</em> together</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">✗ Wrong</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne bois pas jamais</span> d'alcool.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">visité jamais</span> Paris.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il ne boit jamais <span class="highlight hl-neg">du</span> vin.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">✓ Right</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-verb">ne bois jamais</span> d'alcool. <span class="gloss">jamais replaces pas</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-verb">n'ai jamais visité</span> Paris. <span class="gloss">before the participle</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Il ne boit jamais <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> vin. <span class="gloss">du → de</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">💡 <strong>Rule:</strong> a French sentence takes <strong>one</strong> second negative word only.
              <em>pas, jamais, plus, rien, personne</em> are alternatives to each other — never stack <em>pas</em> with another
              (the only common exception is <em>ne… plus jamais</em>).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text">Mon grand-père <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>a <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> pris l'avion.</p>
              <p class="gloss">My grandfather has never taken a plane.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>est <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> en retard.</p>
              <p class="gloss">She is never late.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Nous <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> mangeons <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> viande.</p>
              <p class="gloss">We never eat meat. — de la → de</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> l'oublierai <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais</span>.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I will never forget it. — pronoun inside the sandwich</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — habits and experiences</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.7 — En pleine forme</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne saute jamais le petit déjeuner.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I never skip breakfast.</p>
                <h3>L.6 — Chacun ses goûts</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'écoute jamais de musique classique.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I never listen to classical music.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.5 — Les médias</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Elle ne regarde jamais la télévision le matin.</p>
                <p class="gloss">She never watches TV in the morning.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il ne faut jamais gaspiller l'eau.</p>
                <p class="gloss">One must never waste water.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Choose the correct form</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne va jamais">
                <p class="q-text">1. Il _____ au théâtre. <span class="gloss">(aller — jamais)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne va pas jamais</button><button class="option-btn">ne va jamais</button><button class="option-btn">va jamais</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="n'ai jamais mangé">
                <p class="q-text">2. Je _____ d'escargots. <span class="gloss">(manger — PC)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">n'ai jamais mangé</button><button class="option-btn">n'ai mangé jamais</button><button class="option-btn">ai jamais mangé</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="de">
                <p class="q-text">3. Elle ne boit jamais _____ thé.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">du</button><button class="option-btn">de</button><button class="option-btn">le</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="Jamais">
                <p class="q-text">4. — Tu mens ? — _____ !</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">Ne jamais</button><button class="option-btn">Jamais</button><button class="option-btn">Pas jamais</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne le fera plus jamais">
                <p class="q-text">5. Il _____. <span class="gloss">(ne plus jamais faire + le)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne le fera plus jamais</button><button class="option-btn">ne fera plus jamais le</button><button class="option-btn">ne le fera pas jamais</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-jam-8" data-step="Pratique — à compléter">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">8</span> Pratique — à compléter</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Répondez négativement avec « jamais »</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">1. Il arrive toujours à l'heure. → Il _____ à l'heure.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'arrive jamais" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">2. Nous avons déjà vu ce film. → Nous _____ ce film.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'avons jamais vu" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Elle mange du poisson. → Elle _____ poisson.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne mange jamais de" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Tu es allé en France ? → Non, je _____ en France.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne suis jamais allé|ne suis jamais allée" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. Ils se disputent souvent. → Ils _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne se disputent jamais" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <!-- ================= 3.3 NE… PLUS ================= -->
      <section data-topic="negation" data-topic-name="La Négation" data-sub="Ne… plus">

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Ne… plus — not any more</h2>
            <p class="editable-field"><em>Ne… plus</em> means something <strong>used to be true but has stopped</strong>. English: "no longer", "not any more".</p>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Avant → maintenant</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Avant, je <span class="highlight hl-verb">fumais</span>. <span class="gloss">I used to smoke.</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Maintenant, je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> fume <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span>. <span class="gloss">Now I don't smoke any more.</span></p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L'opposé de « encore / toujours »</h3>
                <table class="subj-table">
                  <tr><td>Il travaille <strong>encore</strong>.</td><td class="gloss">He is still working.</td></tr>
                  <tr><td>Il <span class="key-form">ne</span> travaille <span class="key-form">plus</span>.</td><td class="gloss">He no longer works.</td></tr>
                </table>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">⚠️ Careful with pronunciation: in <em>ne… plus</em> the final <strong>s is silent</strong>.
              When <em>plus</em> means "more" (<em>plus de sucre</em> = more sugar) it is often pronounced. Context tells you which is meant.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule</h2>
            <div class="formula-pipeline">
              <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Sujet</span><span class="f-value">Il</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box" style="border-color:var(--crimson);"><span class="f-label">NE</span><span class="f-value" style="color:var(--crimson);">ne</span></div>
              <div class="f-op">+</div>
              <div class="f-box"><span class="f-label">Verbe + PLUS</span><span class="f-value">habite <span style="color:var(--crimson);">plus</span></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Temps simple</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-verb">habite</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> ici.</p>
                <p class="gloss">She doesn't live here any more.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Temps composé</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">a</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">voulu</span> venir.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He no longer wanted to come.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Article rule applies:</strong>
              <em>Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">d'</span>argent.</em>
              <span class="gloss">I have no money left.</span> — <em>de l'</em> → <em>d'</em></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les exceptions — « plus » positif</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">Négatif — avec « ne »</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> veux <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> de gâteau.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't want any more cake.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> de pain.</p>
                <p class="gloss">There's no bread left.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">Positif — sans « ne »</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je veux <span class="highlight hl-verb">plus</span> de gâteau.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I want more cake.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Elle est <span class="highlight hl-verb">plus</span> grande que moi.</p>
                <p class="gloss">She is taller than me. — comparative</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Combinaisons utiles:</strong>
                <em>ne… plus rien</em> <span class="gloss">nothing any more</span> ·
                <em>ne… plus personne</em> <span class="gloss">nobody any more</span> ·
                <em>ne… plus jamais</em> <span class="gloss">never again</span><br>
                <em>Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> reste <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus rien</span>.</em> <span class="gloss">There is nothing left.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — <em>plus</em> vs <em>encore</em> vs <em>toujours</em></h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <table class="subj-table">
                <tr><th>Français</th><th>Anglais</th><th>Sens</th></tr>
                <tr><td>Il travaille <strong>encore</strong>.</td><td class="gloss">He is still working.</td><td>continue</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Il travaille <strong>toujours</strong>.</td><td class="gloss">He always works / still works.</td><td>continue</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Il <span class="key-form">ne</span> travaille <span class="key-form">plus</span>.</td><td class="gloss">He no longer works.</td><td>arrêté</td></tr>
                <tr><td>Il <span class="key-form">ne</span> travaille <span class="key-form">pas encore</span>.</td><td class="gloss">He isn't working yet.</td><td>pas commencé</td></tr>
              </table>
            </div>
            <div class="box red content-box fragment">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">Erreurs fréquentes</h3>
              <p class="example-text">✗ Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne fume pas plus</span>. → ✓ Je <span class="highlight hl-verb">ne fume plus</span>.</p>
              <p class="example-text">✗ Il n'a <span class="highlight hl-neg">travaillé plus</span>. → ✓ Il n'a <span class="highlight hl-verb">plus travaillé</span>.</p>
              <p class="example-text">✗ Il n'y a plus <span class="highlight hl-neg">du</span> lait. → ✓ Il n'y a plus <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> lait.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text">Mes grands-parents <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>habitent <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> à la campagne.</p>
              <p class="gloss">My grandparents no longer live in the countryside.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> places dans le train.</p>
              <p class="gloss">There are no seats left on the train.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">envie</span> de sortir.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I no longer feel like going out.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Après l'accident, elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>a <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">conduit</span>.</p>
              <p class="gloss">After the accident, she no longer drove. — PC, plus before the participle</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — comparing past and present</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.4 — Le plaisir de lire</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Beaucoup de jeunes ne lisent plus de journaux papier.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Many young people no longer read paper newspapers.</p>
                <h3>L.5 — Les médias</h3>
                <p class="example-text">On n'écrit plus de lettres, on envoie des messages.</p>
                <p class="gloss">People no longer write letters, they send messages.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Cette rivière n'est plus propre.</p>
                <p class="gloss">This river is no longer clean.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.7 — En pleine forme</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Depuis mon régime, je ne mange plus de sucre.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Since my diet, I no longer eat sugar.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">💡 <strong>Essay structure:</strong> <em>Autrefois, on <span class="highlight hl-aux">lisait</span>… ; aujourd'hui, on <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne lit plus</span>…</em>
              — imparfait for the past habit, <em>ne… plus</em> for the change. A ready-made contrast sentence.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Choose the correct form</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne travaille plus">
                <p class="q-text">1. Mon père est retraité : il _____. <span class="gloss">(travailler)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne travaille pas plus</button><button class="option-btn">ne travaille plus</button><button class="option-btn">travaille plus</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="de">
                <p class="q-text">2. Il n'y a plus _____ pain.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">du</button><button class="option-btn">de</button><button class="option-btn">le</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="n'a plus voulu">
                <p class="q-text">3. Elle _____ sortir après cet incident. <span class="gloss">(vouloir — PC)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">n'a voulu plus</button><button class="option-btn">n'a plus voulu</button><button class="option-btn">a plus voulu</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="pas encore">
                <p class="q-text">4. Le bébé ne marche _____. <span class="gloss">(il commencera bientôt)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">plus</button><button class="option-btn">pas encore</button><button class="option-btn">jamais</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne reste plus rien">
                <p class="q-text">5. Il _____ dans le frigo. <span class="gloss">(rester — plus + rien)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne reste plus rien</button><button class="option-btn">ne reste pas rien</button><button class="option-btn">reste plus rien</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-plus-8" data-step="Pratique — à compléter">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">8</span> Pratique — à compléter</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Transformez avec « ne… plus »</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">1. Il fume encore. → Il _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne fume plus" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">2. Nous avons encore du temps. → Nous _____ temps.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'avons plus de" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Elle habite toujours à Lyon. → Elle _____ à Lyon.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'habite plus" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Ils se parlent encore. → Ils _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne se parlent plus" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. J'ai encore vu ce film. → Je _____ ce film.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'ai plus vu" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>
      <!-- ================= 3.4 NE… RIEN ================= -->
      <section data-topic="negation" data-topic-name="La Négation" data-sub="Ne… rien">

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Ne… rien — nothing</h2>
            <p class="editable-field"><em>Rien</em> is the opposite of <em>quelque chose</em> / <em>tout</em>. It can be the <strong>object</strong> or the <strong>subject</strong> of the sentence.</p>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">RIEN comme complément</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> vois <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I see nothing / I don't see anything.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> dit <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He says nothing.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">RIEN comme sujet</h3>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> m'intéresse.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nothing interests me.</p>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>est impossible.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nothing is impossible.</p>
                <p class="gloss">⚠️ Even as subject, <strong>ne</strong> stays before the verb.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Comme réponse seule:</strong> — Qu'est-ce que tu fais ? — <span class="highlight hl-neg">Rien</span>.
              <span class="gloss">— What are you doing? — Nothing.</span> No <em>ne</em> is needed when it stands alone.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule — rien se place comme « pas »</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Temps simple</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">comprends</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't understand anything.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Temps composé — AVANT le participe</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">ai</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">vu</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I saw nothing. — exactly where <em>pas</em> would go</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">RIEN DE + adjectif masculin</h3>
              <p class="example-text">Il n'y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-aux">d'</span>intéressant à la télé.</p>
              <p class="gloss">There's nothing interesting on TV.</p>
              <p class="example-text">Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-aux">de</span> nouveau à raconter.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I have nothing new to tell.</p>
              <p class="gloss">The adjective is always <strong>masculine singular</strong> after <em>rien de</em>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les exceptions — avec un infinitif et des combinaisons</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Avec un infinitif</h3>
                <p>Both words go before the infinitive:</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il préfère <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">dire</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He prefers to say nothing.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je promets de <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">oublier</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I promise not to forget anything.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Combinaisons</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> reste <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus rien</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">There is nothing left.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> dit <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais rien</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">She never says anything.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Order: <em>plus / jamais</em> comes before <em>rien</em>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Expressions utiles:</strong>
                <em>de rien</em> <span class="gloss">you're welcome</span> ·
                <em>rien du tout</em> <span class="gloss">nothing at all</span> ·
                <em>Ça ne fait rien</em> <span class="gloss">It doesn't matter</span> ·
                <em>rien qu'une fois</em> <span class="gloss">just once</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — RIEN before, PERSONNE after</h2>
            <p class="editable-field">In compound tenses these two behave <strong>differently</strong>. This is the single most examined detail of the whole topic.</p>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">RIEN → avant le participe</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">vu</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I saw nothing.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'a <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">compris</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He understood nothing.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">PERSONNE → après le participe</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-verb">vu</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I saw nobody.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'a <span class="highlight hl-verb">rencontré</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He met nobody.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box red content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">✗ <em>Je n'ai vu rien.</em> &nbsp;·&nbsp; ✗ <em>Je n'ai personne vu.</em><br>
              💡 <strong>Memory hook:</strong> <em>rien</em> is short, so it stays <strong>close</strong> to the auxiliary;
              <em>personne</em> is long, so it goes to the <strong>end</strong>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> comprends <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> à ce problème.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I understand nothing about this problem.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> peut m'arrêter.</p>
              <p class="gloss">Nothing can stop me. — rien as subject</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Nous <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>avons <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">acheté</span> au marché.</p>
              <p class="gloss">We bought nothing at the market. — before the participle</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> <span class="highlight hl-aux">de</span> grave.</p>
              <p class="gloss">There's nothing serious. — rien de + masculine adjective</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — Entre Jeunes themes</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.5 — Les médias</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'y a rien d'intéressant à la télévision ce soir.</p>
                <p class="gloss">There's nothing interesting on TV tonight.</p>
                <h3>L.6 — Chacun ses goûts</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Rien ne me plaît autant que la musique.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nothing pleases me as much as music.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Si nous ne faisons rien, la situation empirera.</p>
                <p class="gloss">If we do nothing, the situation will get worse.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.3 — Chercher du travail</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'a rien trouvé malgré ses efforts.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He found nothing despite his efforts.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Choose the correct form</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="n'ai rien mangé">
                <p class="q-text">1. Je _____ ce matin. <span class="gloss">(manger — rien, PC)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">n'ai mangé rien</button><button class="option-btn">n'ai rien mangé</button><button class="option-btn">ai rien mangé</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="Rien ne">
                <p class="q-text">2. _____ m'intéresse dans ce livre.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">Rien ne</button><button class="option-btn">Ne rien</button><button class="option-btn">Rien</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="d'intéressant">
                <p class="q-text">3. Il n'y a rien _____ ici.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">intéressant</button><button class="option-btn">d'intéressant</button><button class="option-btn">de intéressante</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne rien dire">
                <p class="q-text">4. Il vaut mieux _____. <span class="gloss">(dire — infinitif)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne dire rien</button><button class="option-btn">ne rien dire</button><button class="option-btn">rien ne dire</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne reste plus rien">
                <p class="q-text">5. Il _____ dans l'assiette.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne reste plus rien</button><button class="option-btn">ne reste rien plus</button><button class="option-btn">reste plus rien</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-rien-8" data-step="Pratique — à compléter">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">8</span> Pratique — à compléter</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Répondez négativement avec « rien »</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">1. Tu vois quelque chose ? → Non, je _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne vois rien" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">2. Il a acheté quelque chose ? → Non, il _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="n'a rien acheté" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">3. Tout t'intéresse ? → Non, _____ m'intéresse.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="rien ne" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">4. Il y a quelque chose de nouveau ? → Non, il n'y a rien _____ nouveau.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="de" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row">
                <p class="q-text">5. Elle dit quelque chose ? → Non, elle _____.</p>
                <input class="fib-input" data-answer="ne dit rien" placeholder="votre réponse"><span class="fib-verdict"></span>
              </div>
              <div class="accent-bar">
                <span class="ab-label">Accents :</span>
                <button class="accent-key">é</button><button class="accent-key">è</button><button class="accent-key">ê</button>
                <button class="accent-key">à</button><button class="accent-key">ç</button><button class="accent-key">ù</button>
                <button class="accent-key">û</button><button class="accent-key">î</button><button class="accent-key">ô</button>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn fib-check student-only">✓ Vérifier</button>
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
                <button class="retry-btn student-only">🔄 Recommencer</button>
                <span class="score-display">Score : 0 / 5</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <!-- ================= 3.5 NE… PERSONNE ================= -->
      <section data-topic="negation" data-topic-name="La Négation" data-sub="Ne… personne">

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-1" data-step="Description">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">1</span> Description</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Ne… personne — nobody</h2>
            <p class="editable-field"><em>Personne</em> is the opposite of <em>quelqu'un</em> / <em>tout le monde</em>. Like <em>rien</em>, it works as object or subject.</p>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">PERSONNE comme complément</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> vois <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I see nobody.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> connaît <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span> ici.</p>
                <p class="gloss">She knows nobody here.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">PERSONNE comme sujet</h3>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> comprend.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nobody understands.</p>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>est venu.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nobody came.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">⚠️ Don't confuse the two <em>personne</em>s:
                <em><span class="highlight hl-verb">une personne</span></em> = a person (a noun) ·
                <em><span class="highlight hl-neg">ne… personne</span></em> = nobody (a negation).
                The article tells you which is meant.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-2" data-step="Formation">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">2</span> Formation</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">La formule — personne va à la fin</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Temps simple</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">connais</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I know nobody.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Temps composé — APRÈS le participe</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-aux">ai</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">vu</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I saw nobody. — unlike <em>rien</em>!</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box">
              <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">PERSONNE DE + adjectif masculin</h3>
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> connais <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-aux">d'</span>aussi gentil.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I know nobody so kind.</p>
              <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-aux">de</span> disponible.</p>
              <p class="gloss">There is nobody available.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-3" data-step="Exceptions">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">3</span> Exceptions</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Les exceptions — sujet, infinitif, combinaisons</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">Sujet — le verbe reste au singulier</h3>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-verb">est</span> parfait.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nobody is perfect. — singular verb</p>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span><span class="highlight hl-verb">a</span> répondu.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nobody answered.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">Avec un infinitif — personne reste après</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Il préfère <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> <span class="highlight hl-verb">voir</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="gloss">He prefers to see nobody.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Compare: <em>ne rien dire</em> but <em>ne voir personne</em>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box green content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field"><strong>Combinaisons:</strong>
                <em>Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus personne</span>.</em> <span class="gloss">There's nobody left.</span> ·
                <em>Elle <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> voit <span class="highlight hl-neg">jamais personne</span>.</em> <span class="gloss">She never sees anybody.</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-4" data-step="Pièges">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">4</span> Pièges</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">⚠️ Trap Alert — position and agreement</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box red content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--crimson);">✗ Wrong</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne vu</span>.</p>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Personne sont</span> venus.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne connais <span class="highlight hl-neg">pas personne</span>.</p>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'y a personne <span class="highlight hl-neg">disponible</span>.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box green content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--green);">✓ Right</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-verb">vu personne</span>. <span class="gloss">after the participle</span></p>
                <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-verb">Personne n'est</span> venu. <span class="gloss">singular + ne</span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-verb">ne connais personne</span>. <span class="gloss">no <em>pas</em></span></p>
                <p class="example-text">Il n'y a personne <span class="highlight hl-verb">de</span> disponible. <span class="gloss">personne de + adj</span></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="editable-field">🔑 <strong>The pair to memorise:</strong>
                Je n'ai <span class="highlight hl-neg">rien</span> vu. &nbsp;|&nbsp; Je n'ai vu <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span>.<br>
                Say both aloud until the rhythm feels automatic — examiners test exactly this contrast.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-5" data-step="Exemples">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">5</span> Exemples travaillés</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Worked examples</h2>
            <div class="box blue content-box">
              <p class="example-text">Je <span class="highlight hl-neg">ne</span> connais <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span> dans cette ville.</p>
              <p class="gloss">I know nobody in this town.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text"><span class="highlight hl-neg">Personne</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>a compris la question.</p>
              <p class="gloss">Nobody understood the question. — subject, singular verb</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box blue content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Nous <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>avons <span class="highlight hl-verb">rencontré</span> <span class="highlight hl-neg">personne</span> au parc.</p>
              <p class="gloss">We met nobody in the park. — after the participle</p>
            </div>
            <div class="box gold content-box fragment">
              <p class="example-text">Il <span class="highlight hl-neg">n'</span>y a <span class="highlight hl-neg">plus personne</span> au bureau.</p>
              <p class="gloss">There is nobody left at the office.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-6" data-step="En contexte">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">6</span> En contexte</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">In context — Entre Jeunes themes</h2>
            <div class="two-columns">
              <div class="box blue content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0;">L.3 — Chercher du travail</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Personne ne m'a rappelé après l'entretien.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nobody called me back after the interview.</p>
                <h3>L.2 — Après le bac</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je ne connais personne dans cette université.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I don't know anyone at this university.</p>
              </div>
              <div class="box gold content-box">
                <h3 style="margin-top:0; color:var(--gold);">L.8 — L'environnement</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Personne ne peut ignorer le changement climatique.</p>
                <p class="gloss">Nobody can ignore climate change.</p>
                <h3 style="color:var(--gold);">L.6 — Chacun ses goûts</h3>
                <p class="example-text">Je n'ai vu personne au concert hier soir.</p>
                <p class="gloss">I saw nobody at the concert last night.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section data-slide-id="neg-pers-7" data-step="Pratique QCM">
          <div class="slide-card">
            <div class="flag-stripe"></div>
            <div class="step-ribbon"><span class="sr-n">7</span> Pratique — QCM</div>
            <h2 class="editable-field">Choose the correct form</h2>
            <div class="quiz-container">
              <div class="quiz-progress-bar"><div class="quiz-progress-fill"></div></div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="n'ai vu personne">
                <p class="q-text">1. Je _____ à la fête. <span class="gloss">(voir — personne, PC)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">n'ai personne vu</button><button class="option-btn">n'ai vu personne</button><button class="option-btn">ai vu personne</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="Personne n'est">
                <p class="q-text">2. _____ venu à la réunion.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">Personne sont</button><button class="option-btn">Personne n'est</button><button class="option-btn">Personne ne sont</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="ne connais personne">
                <p class="q-text">3. Je _____ ici. <span class="gloss">(connaître)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">ne connais pas personne</button><button class="option-btn">ne connais personne</button><button class="option-btn">connais personne</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="de">
                <p class="q-text">4. Il n'y a personne _____ libre ce soir.</p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">de</button><button class="option-btn">du</button><button class="option-btn">que</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="question-row" data-answer="n'ai rien entendu">
                <p class="q-text">5. Je _____. <span class="gloss">(entendre — rien, PC)</span></p>
                <div class="options"><button class="option-btn">n'ai entendu rien</button><button class="option-btn">n'ai rien entendu</button><button class="option-btn">n'ai rien entendu pas</button></div>
              </div>
              <div class="fib-actions">
                <button class="tb-btn reveal-answers teacher-only">👁️ Afficher les réponses</button>
